# Library Indexes Pack

Use skill `library-indexes-pack` when `vendor_docs` and `context7_required`
are both declared in `entry-spec.yml`.

## Default outputs

- `indexes/<entry>/README.md`
- `indexes/<entry>/doc-api-inventory-crosswalk.json`
- `indexes/<entry>/firecrawl-context7-crosscheck.json` (via cross-check skill)
- `indexes/<entry>/capture-backlog.yml`

Update indexes when adding pages, OpenAPI paths, or repo integration surfaces.
